title: "mutant-coupling-null: a chance-corrected test of mutant-real-fault coupling"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - name: HUMAN_REQUIRED
version: "0.0.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - mutation testing
  - mutant-real-fault coupling
  - test adequacy
  - construct validity
  - chance-corrected coupling
abstract: >-
  Research artifact for a chance-corrected test of mutant-real-fault coupling.
  The primary question is whether a fault-triggering test satisfies the
  historical unique-kill coupling criterion more often than a coverage-matched
  ordinary non-triggering test on the same kill matrices. No results are
  archived in this initialization release. Author identity, ORCID,
  affiliation, repository URL, and archival DOI are HUMAN_REQUIRED and are
  not invented here.
